multi-zone experiences are commonly ~$45k–$130k+; flagship immersive builds can go beyond that depending on fabrication and AV scope.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the timeline?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A focused interactive station can often be delivered in ~6–10 weeks after approval. Larger, highly bespoke installations typically require 10–16+ weeks depending on fabrication, approvals, and onsite constraints.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you handle hardware, AV, and onsite integration?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We can. We design the system and content, and coordinate with your AV integrator or trusted partners for procurement and install. We provide specs, testing plans, and onsite commissioning support.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can content be refreshed seasonally (and in multiple languages)?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We can build CMS-driven updates for copy, languages, visuals, and schedules—so your team can refresh the experience without reopening the whole build.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you provide maintenance / monitoring?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We can offer post-launch support plans depending on your needs: remote monitoring, health checks, content drops, and incident response.\"}}]}"],"features":["contact-form","faq"],"html":"<div class=\"progressive-blur\" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume><div class=\"blur-layer\" style=\"\n            backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0.078125px);\n            z-index: 1;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 12.5%, rgba(0,0,0,1) 25%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 37.5%);\n          \" data-astro-cid-v3ivnume></div><div class=\"blur-layer\" s