n class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-6\">C</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'C'\"></span></span><span class=\"ha-itm\"><span class=\"ha-txt ha-txto ht-7\">T</span><span class=\"ha-txtb ha-txto ht-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"--char: 'T'\"></span></span></span></a></div></header><main><section class=\"lp-hero flx-col-center\"><div class=\"lp-hero__content\"><div class=\"hero-wrapper\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><div class=\"flx-col-center\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><h1 class=\"hero-install-osaka flx-col-center\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><span class=\"sml normal-font\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Interactive Installation Studio in Osaka</span><span data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Build the moment </span><span data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>people share.</span></h1></div><p class=\"hero-install-sub\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>An Osaka-based interactive installation studio for brands, museums, and public spaces.<br>Real-time 3D × sensors × generative systems—built to earn attention, emotion, and sharing.</p></div><div class=\"lp-hero__ctas\"><a href=\"https://www.kiasa.tech/source_url=%2Fosaka-interactive-installation-studio\" class=\"lp-btn lp-btn-- \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free consult</a><a href=\"#works\" class=\"lp-btn lp-btn-- \" target>View Osaka work</a></div></div></section><div class=\"lp-hero__media hero-media-ee\"><video autoplay loop muted playsinline aria-label=\"Interactive installations in Osaka built with real-time 3D and sensors.\"><source src=\"/landing/common/installation_hero.mp4\" media=\"(min-width: 1920px)\"><source src=\"/landing/common/installation_hero_medium.mp4\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\"><source src=\"/landing/common/installation_hero_sp.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"lp-sections flx-column\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><section class=\"lp-clients flx-col-center\"><p class=\"lp-clients__info med-txt\">We’re an award-winning studio<br> trusted by leading brands.</p><div class=\"lp-clients-wrapper\"><div class=\"lp-clients-scroll\"><div class=\"lp-clients__track\"><div class=\"lp-clients__group\"><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/jr.svg\" alt=\"JR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/lv.svg\" alt=\"Louis Vuitton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"35\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/kia.svg\" alt=\"Kia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/league-of-legends.svg\" alt=\"League of Legends\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/bmw.svg\" alt=\"BMW\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/warner.svg\" alt=\"Warner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/smrj.svg\" alt=\"SMRJ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\"></div></div><div class=\"lp-clients__group\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/jr.svg\" alt=\"JR\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"50\" height=\"36\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/lv.svg\" alt=\"Louis Vuitton\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"35\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/kia.svg\" alt=\"Kia\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"24\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/league-of-legends.svg\" alt=\"League of Legends\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"90\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/bmw.svg\" alt=\"BMW\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/warner.svg\" alt=\"Warner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"34\"></div><div class=\"lp-clients__logo\"><img src=\"/clients/smrj.svg\" alt=\"SMRJ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"74\" height=\"41\"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-highlight\"><p class=\"lp-highlight__text client-ee-highlight\">For Osaka-based teams, we create <span class='down'>interactive installations</span> that turn visitors into storytellers—designed for emotion, clarity, and filming.</p></section><section class=\"why-section flx-column big-pt\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h2 data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Why Osaka teams choose<br> interactive installations</h2><div class=\"why-items\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Because “space” is now a media channel.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Web and ads are crowded. Interactive installations create <strong>physical attention</strong>—a moment people feel, film, and remember.</p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Because you need shareable moments (without gimmicks).</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>We design <strong>camera-friendly interactions</strong> that support your story—so visitors share the experience, not just a selfie.</p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Because content must refresh (seasons, events, languages).</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>We can ship a <strong>CMS-ready system</strong> for rotating content, bilingual UI, and timed variants—without rebuilding hardware.</p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Because reliability matters on-site.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>We build with <strong>failsafes</strong>, clear runbooks, and remote support options—so your installation stays stable during peak hours.</p></div><div class=\"why-item\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Because you want a studio that can actually build it.</h3><p data-astro-cid-t3m5hsgw>Not just “concept decks.” We handle <strong>interaction design + engineering</strong>—real-time 3D, sensors/CV, performance, and deployment.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"big-py\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><section id=\"services\" class=\"services\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__inner flx-column\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__header\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__heading\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><p class=\"services__eyebrow\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb>Interactive installations, projection mapping, and real-time systems—built in Osaka</p><h2 class=\"services__title\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb>What we build</h2></div></div><div class=\"services__grid\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__card bg-card \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__video-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><video src=\"/landing/hotel-interactive-installations/immersive-experiences.mp4\" class=\"services__image\" autoplay loop muted playsinline data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md></video></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Interactive Digital Installations</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Sensor-driven experiences that react to presence, motion, or touch—built with real-time 3D and generative systems to create “only-here, only-now” moments.</p></div></div><div class=\"services__card bg-card \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__video-wrapper blend-exclusion\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><video src=\"/landing/common/matrix.mp4\" class=\"services__image\" autoplay loop muted playsinline data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md></video></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Real-time 3D & Generative Systems</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Real-time visuals that respond to people or live data—ideal for brand activations, HQ lobbies, museums, and public installations that need continuous novelty.</p></div></div><div class=\"services__card bg-card \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__image-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><img src=\"/_astro/people-analytics.9g8_LZl8_Yjp3v.webp\" alt=\"Real-time dashboard showing privacy-safe analytics for an interactive installation.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"800\" height=\"599\" class=\"services__image\"></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Content Ops: CMS + Multilingual + Analytics</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Make updates easy for your team: languages, seasonal variants, QR handoffs, and privacy-safe reporting (dwell time / attention metrics) based on your policy.</p></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"big-py\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><section data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><div class=\"about-us\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><h2 data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Your Osaka partner for<br data-astro-cid-7m4tvems> interactive installations</h2><div class=\"about-us-content\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><h3 class=\"normal-font\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>\nDesigned, engineered, and deployed end-to-end\n</h3><p data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>\nWe are Kiasa, an <strong data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>interactive installation studio in Osaka</strong> creating digital installations, immersive experiences, and projection\n              mapping across Osaka and Kansai.<br data-astro-cid-7m4tvems> We combine storytelling with\n              technology—so the work isn’t just “cool,” it’s coherent, reliable, and\n              built for real spaces.\n</p><ul class=\"about-us-list flx-column\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><li data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><strong data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Interaction design</strong>: mechanics that match\n                visitor flow (fast, intuitive, filmable)\n</li><li data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><strong data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Engineering</strong>: real-time 3D, generative visuals,\n                sensor/CV inputs, performance\n</li><li data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><strong data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Installation readiness</strong>: specs, testing plans,\n                runbooks, and launch support\n</li><li data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><strong data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>Operations</strong>: multilingual UI, seasonal updates,\n                CMS options, and support plans\n</li></ul><p class=\"about-us-local\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems>\nWe are based near Shinsaibashi (Chuo Ward, Osaka).<br data-astro-cid-7m4tvems> Common service\n              areas: Umeda, Namba, Tennoji, Sakai—plus Kyoto/Kobe/Nara.\n</p></div></div></section></div><div class=\"big-py\" id=\"works\" data-astro-cid-7m4tvems><section id=\"services\" class=\"services\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__inner flx-column\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__header\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><div class=\"services__heading\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><p class=\"services__eyebrow\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb>Custom-built installations designed for curiosity (and sharing)</p><h2 class=\"services__title\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb>Osaka / Kansai work</h2></div></div><div class=\"services__grid\" data-astro-cid-zr2xhnpb><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zYeUg-8WQrM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"services__card bg-card sc-link\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__image-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><img src=\"/_astro/jr.Dn1pvQvw_Z24RYr8.webp\" alt=\"JR West digital installation turning messages into a real-time 3D city.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" class=\"services__image\"></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>JR West<br>Digital Installation (Osaka)</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>An interpretive digital artwork that transforms voices into a living 3D city—designed to spark emotion, conversation, and internal cultural alignment.</p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kvlrPu4QMA0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"services__card bg-card sc-link\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__image-wrapper \" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><img src=\"/_astro/expo.Cy-WBb7e_Wo44X.webp\" alt=\"Interactive installation at Expo 2025 Osaka, Kansai where movement generates dynamic waves.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" class=\"services__image\"></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Expo 2025 Osaka, Kansai<br>Interactive Installation</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>A participatory installation where visitor movement brings a wave to life—generating evolving visuals in real time, unique to every crowd.</p></div></a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oHh_iYVLttU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"services__card bg-card sc-link\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\"><div class=\"services__image-wrapper blend-exclusion\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><img src=\"/_astro/smrj.BE2eHcve_N3nmW.webp\" alt=\"Interactive installation visualizing 1,800 messages across three projection screens.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" class=\"services__image\"></div><div class=\"services__body\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md><h3 class=\"services__card-title normal-font\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>Voyage to the Future<br>Interactive Installation</h3><p class=\"service-item-text\" data-astro-cid-k2o5k7md>A living archive built from 1,800 messages—animated across three projection screens and curated live via iPads to create a shared, evolving story.</p></div></a></div></div></section></div><section id=\"faqs\" class=\"lp-faq flx-column\"><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main \">FAQs</h2></div><div class=\"lp-faq__list\"><div class=\"lp-faq__item open\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What types of interactive installations do you produce?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: none;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Interactive digital installations, immersive rooms, projection mapping, LED-wall / large-display content, sensor-driven experiences, and real-time 3D / generative systems. We tailor interaction mechanics to your space and visitor flow.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">−</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What’s the typical budget range in Osaka / Japan?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>It depends on size, hardware, AV, and bespoke creative. As a rough guide: single interactive stations often start around ~$15k–$45k; multi-zone experiences are commonly ~$45k–$130k+; flagship immersive builds can go beyond that depending on fabrication and AV scope.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>What is the timeline?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>A focused interactive station can often be delivered in ~6–10 weeks after approval. Larger, highly bespoke installations typically require 10–16+ weeks depending on fabrication, approvals, and onsite constraints.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you handle hardware, AV, and onsite integration?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>We can. We design the system and content, and coordinate with your AV integrator or trusted partners for procurement and install. We provide specs, testing plans, and onsite commissioning support.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can content be refreshed seasonally (and in multiple languages)?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We can build CMS-driven updates for copy, languages, visuals, and schedules—so your team can refresh the experience without reopening the whole build.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Do you provide maintenance / monitoring?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We can offer post-launch support plans depending on your needs: remote monitoring, health checks, content drops, and incident response.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>Can we meet in Osaka for an in-person discussion?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p>Yes. We can meet in Osaka City (around Shinsaibashi). See map: <a href='https://maps.app.goo.gl/YNMmcpeVudtSNTPy6' target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Osaka studio area</a>.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div><div class=\"lp-faq__item\" data-faq-item><button class=\"lp-faq__q\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-faq-toggle><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">Q.</span><span>How do we start?</span></button><div class=\"lp-faq__a\" style=\"max-height: 0;\"><span class=\"lpfi-ill\">A.</span><p><a href=\"https://www.kiasa.tech/source_url=%2Fosaka-interactive-installation-studio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a free 30-minute consultation</a>. Share your venue photos/floor plan, target audience, desired \"share moment,\" and timeline—we'll return a concept direction and budget range.</p></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lp-faq__icon\">+</span></div></div></section><section class=\"lp-contact flx-center\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-card bg-card\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact-mc flx\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-contact__head\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-title  align-left\"><h2 class=\"lp-title__main small\">Build an installation people<br> can’t stop talking about.</h2><p class=\"lp-title__sub \">Start with a free consult.</p></div></div><form class=\"lp-form\" id=\"contact-form\" action=\"/api/contact\" method=\"post\" novalidate data-recaptcha-key=\"6LdRYBYsAAAAAA2OQWd799h3rjCrQmjpitTquLri\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"page\" value=\"https://www.utsubo.com/osaka-interactive-installation-studio\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"g-recaptcha-response\" value=\"\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap;\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><label for=\"lp-hp-field\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef>Leave this field empty</label><input id=\"lp-hp-field\" type=\"text\" name=\"hp_field\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef></div><div class=\"lp-form__grid\" data-astro-cid-7b6a54ef><div class=\"lp-form__field\"><label class=\"lp-form__label\" for=\"fld-name\"> Name <span class=\"lp-form__req\">*</span></label><input class=\"lp-form__input\" id=\"fld-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" placeholder value required autocomplete=\"name\"><p class=\"lp-form__error\" data-error-for=\"name\">Please fill out this field.</p></div><div class=\"lp-form__field\"><label class=\"lp-form__label\" for=\"fld-email\"> Email <span class=\"lp-form__req\">*</span></label><input class=\"lp-form__input\" id=\"fld-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder value required autocomplete=\"email\"><p class=\"lp-form__error\" data-error-for=\"email\"></p></div><div class=\"lp-form__field\"><label class=\"lp-form__label\" for=\"fld-location\"> Project location  </label><div class=\"relative w-100\"><select class=\"lp-form__select\" id=\"fld-location\" name=\"location\"><option value=\"\">Select…</option><option value=\"Osaka City\">Osaka City</option><option value=\"Osaka Prefecture (outside city)\">Osaka Prefecture (outside city)</option><option value=\"Kansai (Kyoto / Kobe / Nara)\">Kansai (Kyoto / Kobe / Nara)</option><option value=\"Other (Japan / Global)\">Other (Japan / Global)</option><option value=\"Not sure yet\">Not sure yet</option></select><svg class=\"select-arrow\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\"